      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246349/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a nonstick skillet over medium heat; cook and stir onion until fragrant, about 2 minutes. Add noodles and stir for 2 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dQ86SAnsHlJ-hCUwEBQuNOWtRHc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/246349-ramen-scrambled-eggs-ddmfs-step-3-0168-85138c916f774cf3bd42ba6a0a06c93c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246349/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs, water, and salt together in a bowl; pour into the same skillet as the noodle mixture. Cook and stir eggs until set and cooked through, 2 to 4 minutes.",
